                      "content": "Still photos and polished profiles let people hide behind a curated version of themselves. Cats or Dogs? is built around short, on-camera answers to the same daily question for everyone. You hear someone's voice, see their face in the moment, and get an honest read on who they are. That is how matches start with substance, not guesswork.",
